eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L88-L90","doc":"**The Alt eigenvalue has modulus `q⁻¹`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.alt_eigen_arg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.alt_eigen_arg","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L83-L86","doc":"**The Alt eigenvalue has phase `π`** for `q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist_unit","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L75-L81","doc":"**On the direction, the half twist is the fibre flow `θ ↦ θ + πt`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.fullTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.fullTwist","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L71-L73","doc":"**Two half twists are a full turn.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist_add","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L64-L69","doc":"**The half twist is a flow.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist_one","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L59-L62","doc":"**One half twist exchanges**: `r ↦ −r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.halfTwist","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L56-L57","doc":"The half twist at time `t`: rotate the relative coordinate by `π t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.exchange_relative","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.exchange_relative","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L53-L54","doc":"**Exchange negates the relative coordinate**: `r` spans the sign representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.exchange_center","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ConvolutionFlowFibre.exchange_center","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ConvolutionFlowFibre.lean#L50-L51","doc":"**Exchange fixes the centre.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}